=== layout: one-panel

# [*Don't Panic*]{color=red}

@body

- If a limited-attempt quiz/exam is interrupted, close it without viewing more questions.
- Contact me immediately: Discord preferred; email is also fine.
- I will respond when I am available.
- Recovery depends on how much you viewed:
  - Less than 10%: I can reset the assessment.
  - 10-90%: I will usually replace only the unseen questions.
  - Entire assessment: I can offer a second attempt and average both scores.
- Regular assignments allow unlimited retries: start a fresh attempt when technology is available.

@citation

https://vosslab.github.io/syllabus/fall_2026/genetics/ASSIGNMENTS_AND_GRADING/

=== layout: one-panel

# *Illness Policy*

@body

- Since COVID, I am trying to be more considerate of student illnesses.
- [If you are sick, let me know. I will provide an extension.]{color=#C9211E}
- If a major event interferes (car accident, etc.), again contact me.
- Communication is always helpful.

